# The T4 milestone: a whole module. `source_stems` calls `fm_sources`
# (llm-wiki tools/synapse.py, unannotated: its reviewed signature comes as a
# stub) as its comprehension's iterable and `normalize_stem` (tools/wiki.py)
# inside the body, and is written FIRST -- the kernel ranks the callees below
# it. The name is "" (the whole module, every top-level def); the expected
# block is the emitted file plus its span map, and the judge runs the same
